# Agent Behavior

Before coding, read `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, and `0_docs/PROJECT_STATUS_CURRENT.md`. Preserve the research chain and do not jump ahead. Every new file needs a description in the nearest README and `0_docs/FILE_CATALOG.md`. Filesystem create/move/delete/rename operations must be logged in `01_Lab_Journal/operation_log.md`.

Never fabricate results. Keep Markdown frontmatter valid. Use clear English or Chinese comments for EEG-specific decisions.
